---
// Thank-you po zapisie na magnes PM (lejek D88). Cel redirectu z /api/subscribe gdy list=pm.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Gotowe — First 5 PM Days</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    :root{--navy:#225378;--sky:#EBF3F9;--ink:#1C2B3A;--brass:#A67A38;--gray:#4A5E6D;--line:#D6E1EC}
    body{font-family:'Montserrat',-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--sky);line-height:1.6;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center}
    .wrap{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px}
    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:44px 38px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(34,83,120,.08)}
    .tick{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sky);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px}
    .tick svg{width:30px;height:30px;stroke:var(--brass);stroke-width:2.5;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
    h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:14px}
    p{font-size:16px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:12px}
    p strong{color:var(--navy)}
    .sig{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--sky);font-size:14px;color:var(--gray)}
    .foot{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:20px}
    .foot a{color:var(--brass);text-decoration:none}
    a.disc{color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg></div>
      <h1>Gotowe. Plan już leci.</h1>
      <p><strong>First 5 PM Days</strong> jest w drodze na Twoją skrzynkę. Sprawdź maila (a gdyby go nie było w ciągu minuty, zajrzyj do spamu i oznacz jako „nie spam").</p>
      <p>W mailu masz też wejście na darmowego Discorda dla PM. Jeśli chcesz od razu: <a class="disc" href="https://discord.gg/ZV5jxsPXT">discord.gg/ZV5jxsPXT</a></p>
      <div class="sig">Do zobaczenia w środku.<br><strong>Krzysztof</strong></div>
    </div>
    <p class="foot"><a href="https://krzysztofnyrek.pl">krzysztofnyrek.pl</a></p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
